    narr:narration """This hub gathers the calibration record for the Kestrelwood spectrograph, dated 20260717. [The instrument identification](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_3) establishes the Kestrelwood spectrograph as the named subject. [The calibration figure](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_1) sets the operating frequency at 88.4 MHz, stated as a present-tense settled fact. [The verification claim](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_2) extends this by asserting the figure was checked against June reference plates and holds across the full observing band — moving from a single-point number to a band-wide confirmation. [The session-level record](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_4) restates both the figure and the verification basis as a consolidated decision bullet. The [broader narrative frame](narr:Narrative_InstrumentCalibrationVerification) situates this as a transition from unverified to reference-verified instrument readiness, the precondition for deployment. No dissent or alternative figure appears; the children converge on a single calibration state.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_1> ;
